DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T150000
UID:69a85b71b48451fc3c069f76@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Romance Book Club\, where love stories take cen
 ter stage and every page promises a new adventure of the heart. Whether yo
 u're into slow burns\, second chances\, or enemies-to-lovers\, there's som
 ething here for every kind of romantic. Come read\, swoon\, and share your
  favorite moments with fellow book lovers.\nThe Romance Book Club title fo
 r Saturday June 13 2026 is\nProblematic Summer Romance\nby Ali Hazelwood.
 \nPlease note that this book club is for individuals 18+.\nLimited copies 
 will be available in branch for pick up.\nDrop in\, no registration requir
 ed.\nThis program was previously scheduled for June 6 and has been re-sche
 duled to June 13.
LOCATION:Maryvale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a85b71b48451fc3c069f76
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
